    "description": "Voxa Workflow 4 — handles Stripe lifecycle events forwarded by /api/stripe/webhook. Switches on body.kind: subscription_deleted releases Twilio number, deletes EL agent, archives agents row, WhatsApps owner. invoice_payment_failed pauses agents and WhatsApps owner with billing-portal link."
